If ye ever stumble 'cross some[BR]
treasures and nick-nacks, ye know[BR]
who to give a bell to, eh?[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Crikey, ye say ya dun have any[BR]
rotaries 'round?[BR]
[Pause 10]Arr, well, them smart mobiles will[BR]
accomplish jus' fine too.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
F'now, me and the missus will be[BR]
lollygagging about.[BR]
[Pause 12]Quality time, as you blokes say.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}

